Figure 1. Heatmaps of CYPs specifically expressed in the roots of four plants (RB: root bark; RX: root xylem; RP: root phloem; PS: peeled stem;
SB: stem periderm; L: leaf; F: flower; R: root; S: stem). The candidates connected by red, green, and gray lines in the figure are the CYPs whose
corresponding isoenzyme gene sequences could be found in the other three, two, and one plant mentioned above, respectively.
